1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:04,770
(Leonard (singing):)Hit on me, hit on me

2
00:00:05,080 --> 00:00:10,120
(Leonard (singing):)Sorry Alex hit on me
I had no idea I'm cute

3
00:00:14,360 --> 00:00:15,770
Aw. Damn it, you are.

4
00:00:17,160 --> 00:00:20,290
(Leonard:)Please forgive me,
I should have told you about Alex.

5
00:00:20,440 --> 00:00:23,170
(Penny:)I don't care about Alex. Fine, I care.

6
00:00:23,320 --> 00:00:25,080
Okay, I hate the bitch.

7
00:00:26,080 --> 00:00:28,450
(Penny:)But what really hurt
is that you liked it so much.

8
00:00:28,640 --> 00:00:29,800
(Penny:)Do I need to be worried?

9
00:00:30,080 --> 00:00:31,810
(Leonard:)Of course not. No. Why?

10
00:00:31,960 --> 00:00:34,850
Because she's pretty and smart
and when you talk about work...

11
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:37,650
...she doesn't have to look up words
in the dictionary...

12
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:39,610
(Penny:)...to understand what you said.

13
00:00:39,760 --> 00:00:41,920
(Leonard:)- You do that?
- No.

14
00:00:43,960 --> 00:00:47,600
(Leonard:)Hang on. Are you feeling insecure?
Because that's my thing.

15
00:00:47,760 --> 00:00:51,450
(Leonard:)And if you take it away, I don't know
what I'm bringing to this relationship.

16
00:00:51,720 --> 00:00:54,850
(Penny:)Yes, Leonard, I am insecure. Happy?

17
00:00:55,040 --> 00:01:01,020
(Leonard:)No, I'm not happy.

